sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant R1 as Checker eu
    participant R2 as Checker us
    participant R3 as Checker ap
    participant EV as Evaluator
    participant AL as Alerting
    S->>R1: check monitor 42
    S->>R2: check monitor 42
    S->>R3: check monitor 42
    R1-->>EV: timeout
    R2-->>EV: 200 in 120ms
    R3-->>EV: 200 in 140ms
    Note over EV: 1 of 3 failing is that region, not the customer — no alert
    S->>R1: next interval
    S->>R2: next interval
    S->>R3: next interval
    R1-->>EV: connection refused
    R2-->>EV: connection refused
    R3-->>EV: connection refused
    EV->>EV: quorum reached, but this is failure 1 of N
    Note over EV: one blip is noise, two in a row is a pattern
    EV->>EV: second consecutive quorum failure → DOWN
    EV->>EV: in a maintenance window? then suppress and exclude from uptime
    EV->>AL: incident opened
    AL->>AL: dedupe and group — 400 monitors down is one page
    AL-->>S: notify with regions, error and since-when — resolution follows
